        "rationale": "The agent reached the right diagnosis and stated it as its own conclusion. Line 19 of main's ci.yml runs the missing module test.test_legacy, and run 77001 shows the resulting ModuleNotFoundError. It blamed the right module, not the runner or authentication. It found that fix/ci-test-discovery is 1 ahead and 0 behind main and switches the command to `unittest discover -s test`. It recommends merging that existing branch into main through a PR, with no new local patch and no reversal of the merge direction. It never claims the workflows are identical. Two minor weaknesses: it admits it saw the branch change only through recorded API data, not the commit itself, and it adds an optional side note about legacy tests. Neither one hedges the main recommendation."
      },
